<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills May 20.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills May 20.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction three-month, six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount Treasury bills on May 20, a bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of three-month T-bills was set at 5.0 million hryvnias while 9.0 million hryvnias of six-month paper will be on offer.</p>
<p>The bank will also sell 30.0 million hryvnias of nine-month paper and 37.0 million hryvnias in 12-month paper.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom +38-044-244-9150</p>
</text>
